          "message": "Fix PartitionSpec.getActualSize()\n\nFix autopart run with the new pyparted.",
          "author": "David Cantrell",
          "date": "2009-02-10T02:52:04Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "033f973c70a2afe528caa8863823cbccbfc88172",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/rhinstaller/anaconda/commit/033f973c70a2afe528caa8863823cbccbfc88172",
          "message": "getPartitionByPath expects the device to start with /dev/.",
          "author": "Chris Lumens",
          "date": "2009-02-06T21:43:24Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "4dd3e4a3e98825c1d542bb03a58724a2db098765",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/rhinstaller/anaconda/commit/4dd3e4a3e98825c1d542bb03a58724a2db098765",
          "message": "Use parted.Disk.getPartitionByPath()\n\nRemoved the parted.getPartitionByName() function.  There is now\na method on parted.Disk called getPartitionByPath() which provides\nthe same functionality, but only works on a single Disk.",
